1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,100
Resizing is not repurposing.

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:07,000
A letterboxed video is just resized.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,500
Black bars waste the screen.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,400
Reframing keeps the speaker in view.

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,100
Then add captions.

6
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:21,000
Do you reframe or just resize?
